# Environment — NEVER commit real secrets (see claude.md §13.10)
# Deny every .env* by default, then allow back the one template file. The
# previous list enumerated known names, so .env.sentry-build-plugin — which the
# Sentry wizard writes, and which carries an org auth token — was not matched
# and was committed to a public repository.
.env*
!.env.example

# Supabase local
supabase/.branches/
supabase/.temp/
supabase/.env

